cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this comparison or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "ORCID profiles at member and non-member institutions"
abstract: >-
  Completeness of the public ORCID profiles found through the ROR ids of 120 research
  institutions, 20 per continent, compared between ORCID members and other institutions: overall,
  year by year of account creation, by link to the institution, and by who wrote each entry. The
  aggregated results in data/ are under CC BY 4.0; the code is under MIT. Profile-level data are
  available for research on request.
type: software
